LEWIS COUNTY Disaster Loan Outreach Center Lewis County Courthouse Room 023, Basement (East End) 351 NW North St. Chehalis, WA 98532

Mondays — Thursdays, 8:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. Fridays, 8:00 a.m. – 3:30 p.m.

SKAGIT COUNTY Disaster Loan Outreach Center Sedro-Woolley City Hall Municipal Training Room, 2nd Floor 325 Metcalf St. Sedro-Woolley, WA 98284

